# A DOMAIN FIRES ON AN ASSERTED EDGE (SPEC 5.3 L2, L6). domain(r) = C is
# ∃r.⊤ ⊑ C; it reaches a only if the asserted edge r(a,b) is visible to CR4 and
# ⊤ is seeded in b's context. D(a), C disjoint from D.
# Expect: INCONSISTENT (exit 1).

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class . :C owl:disjointWith :D .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty .
:r rdfs:domain :C .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual , :D . :b a owl:NamedIndividual .
:a :r :b .
